    <string name="settings_field_omit_thinking_parameters">Omit thinking parameters</string>
    <string name="settings_field_hint_omit_thinking_parameters">Debug comparison, on by default. Omits reasoning_effort, thinking budgets and the thinking beta header from translation, repair and summary requests. Uses provider defaults; does not guarantee thinking is disabled. Keeps your selected strength and streaming mode. Applies to newly started tasks.</string>
    <string name="settings_field_enable_api_body_logging">Log API request and response bodies</string>
    <string name="settings_field_hint_enable_api_body_logging">Off by default. Saves translation and repair request bodies and raw responses, including thinking and text, to daily internal log files and logcat. Produces large logs; headers are omitted and the API key is redacted. Applies to newly started tasks.</string>
